  "_note": "Which clock each column of games.csv resolves on. The as-of feature engine reads THIS, not a hardcoded list, so the guard and the data cannot drift apart. 'schedule' is safe at T-24; 'result' (kickoff+4h) and 'stats' (kickoff+36h) are leakage hazards for any T-24 feature.",
